My version of the Vigenere Cypher is that:
 - it is case insensitive (doesn't matter if it's uppercase or lowercase)
 - and it ignores any non-alphabetic characters (spaces, punctuation, numbers, etc.)

Project 1: Server handles one client
Run oc_server.py and then run client.py

Project 2: Server handles multiple clients
Run mc_server.py then run client.py

Use this website to verify if the encryption/decryption is correct:
https://www.cs.du.edu/~snarayan/crypt/vigenere.html